<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <%- include('../partials/styles') %>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="row">
            <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

            <main class="col-md-9 ms-sm-auto col-lg-10 px-md-4">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap flex-md-nowrap align-items-center pt-3 pb-2 mb-3 border-bottom">
                    <h1 class="h2">내정보</h1>
                </div>

                <% if (success) { %>
                    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                        <%= success %>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
                    </div>
                <% } %>

                <% if (error) { %>
                    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                        <%= error %>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
                    </div>
                <% } %>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-8">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <h5 class="mb-0">개인정보</h5>
                                <a href="/teacher/profile/edit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                                    <i class="bi bi-pencil"></i> 수정
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="row mb-3">
                                    <div class="col-sm-3">
                                        <strong>이름</strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <%= teacher.name %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-3">
                                    <div class="col-sm-3">
                                        <strong>이메일</strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <%= teacher.email %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-3">
                                    <div class="col-sm-3">
                                        <strong>전화번호</strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <%= teacher.phone || '-' %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-3">
                                    <div class="col-sm-3">
                                        <strong>권한</strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                                        <% if (adminUser.code === 'O') { %>
                                            <span class="badge bg-success">관리자</span>
                                        <% } else if (adminUser.code === 'T') { %>
                                            <span class="badge bg-primary">선생님</span>
                                        <% } else { %>
                                            <span class="badge bg-secondary">일반</span>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <h5 class="mb-0">안전 설정</h5>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                                    <a href="/teacher/profile/edit" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
                                        <i class="bi bi-key"></i> 비밀번호 변경
                                    </a>
                                    <a href="/teacher/profile/edit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">
                                        <i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> 이메일 변경
                                    </a>
                                    <a href="/teacher/profile/edit" class="btn btn-outline-info">
                                        <i class="bi bi-telephone"></i> 전화번호 변경
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="card mt-3">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <h5 class="mb-0">계정 정보</h5>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <small class="text-muted">
                                    개인정보 수정 시 이메일 중복 확인이 이루어집니다.<br>
                                    비밀번호는 6자리 이상으로 설정해주세요.<br>
                                    정보 변경 후 다시 로그인이 필요할 수 있습니다.
                                </small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </main>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('../partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>